icomoon/

# Local scratch work, such as design studies and mock-ups
/work/

# Python bytecode, written when nocturne/wallpaper loads nocturne/build and
# when ranger loads its plugins
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Personal data and credentials never belong here. Several folders are linked
# into ~/.config, so apps can write these files into the repo; keep them out.
**/hosts.yml
**/auth.json
**/.credentials.json
**/credentials.json
**/development_credentials
**/global_settings.json
**/settings.local.json
**/allowed_signers
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_*
**/.env
**/.env.*
